ifty quid.","tr":"O ceket elli sterlindi."}]}],"variants":[],"phonetic":null,"band":1},{"id":"gen-b2-quill","headword":"quill","cefr":"C1","sourceCollection":"extended","sourceOrder":3458,"sourceEntry":"quill n.","senses":[{"id":"gen-b2-quill-n","partOfSpeech":"n.","turkishMeanings":["tüy kalem","kirpi dikeni","kuş tüyü"],"examples":[{"en":"He wrote with a quill.","tr":"Tüy kalemle yazdı."},{"en":"The porcupine raised its quills.","tr":"Oklu kirpi dikenlerini kaldırdı."},{"en":"The quill needed fresh ink.","tr":"Tüy kalem taze mürekkep istedi."}]}],"variants":[],"phonetic":"/kwɪl/","band":2},{"id":"gen-b3-quilt","headword":"quilt","cefr":"C1","sourceCollection":"extended","sourceOrder":4369,"sourceEntry":"quilt n., v.","senses":[{"id":"gen-b3-quilt-n","partOfSpeech":"n.","turkishMeanings":["yorgan","kapitone örtü"],"examples":[{"en":"She sewed a patchwork quilt.","tr":"Yamalı bir yorgan dikti."},{"en":"The quilt is warm and heavy.","tr":"Yorgan sıcak ve ağır."},{"en":"The quilt was made by her grandmother.","tr":"Yorganı büyükannesi yapmıştı."}]},{"id":"gen-b3-quilt-v","partOfSpeech":"v.","turkishMeanings":["kapitone dikmek","yorgan dikmek"],"examples":[{"en":"She quilted the whole winter.","tr":"Bütün kış yorgan dikti."},{"en":"The jacket is quilted for warmth.","tr":"Ceket sıcak tutsun diye kapitone dikilmiş."},{"en":"They quilted the fabric in squares.","tr":"Kumaşı kareler hâlinde kapitone diktiler."}]}],"variants":[],"phonetic":"/kwɪlt/","band":3},{"id":"gen-b4-quint","headword":"quint","cefr":"C1","sourceCollection":"extended","sourceOrder":6617,"sourceEntry":"quint n.","senses":[{"id":"gen-b4-quint-n","partOfSpeech":"n.","turkishMeanings":["beşiz","beşli grup"],"examples":[{"en":"She gave birth to a quint.","tr":"Beşiz doğurdu."},{"en":"The quint filled the house with noise.","tr":"Beşizler evi gürültüyle doldurdu."},{"en":"A quint is very rare.","tr":"Beşiz çok nadirdir."}]}],"variants":[],"phonetic":null,"band":4},{"id":"gen-b3-quirky","headword":"quirky","